109. When might caching a hash code make sense?


110. What makes an object a good HashMap key?


111. Why should equality-significant fields normally be stable?



The module explicitly emphasizes the rule equal objects must have equal hash codes, while equal hashes do not imply equality, and highlights mutable keys and hash distribution as major concerns. 


